  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "The frequency of echo will be _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Hz</mi></math> if the train blowing a whistle of frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>320</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math> is moving with a velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> towards a hill from which an echo is heard by the train driver. Velocity of sound in air is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>330</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "340",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The hill will be a secondary source.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f1b7d908-721c-4516-ad82-f5238ec9b6aa-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 100px;\" /></p><p>When the train moves towards the hill then,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo></math> frequency of the train&nbsp;w.r.t. the hill is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>330</mn><mn>320</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>320</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>330</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p><p>When the train driver hears an echo, then velocity of observer is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo></math> Frequency of the sound reflected by hill w.r.t. the car (echo)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mfenced><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>330</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>330</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>330</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>340</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
